<title>CANADA: Moore Corp Ltd Q4 share net jumps.</title>
<headline>Moore Corp Ltd Q4 share net jumps.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			US$0.42		  US$0.22</p>
<p> Net			 42,289		   22,432</p>
<p> Revs		     664,591		  693,813</p>
<p>	   12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			US$1.50		  US$2.68</p>
<p> Net			149,923		  267,501</p>
<p> Revs		   2,517,673		2,602,254</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: 1996 earnings included an after tax gain of US$25 million on the sale of Moore's option to acquire 51 percent of JetForm Corp. 1995 earnings included an after tax gain of US$147 million on the reduction of Moore's equity interest in Toppan Moore Co Ltd.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
